// =====================================================================================
// INTERVIEW TAB — AI Mock Interviewer with NLP / Speech Analysis. A multi-turn
// adaptive interview where every answer is scored for filler-word rate, hedging
// language, pace (WPM), sentiment/confidence, STAR structure and technical depth,
// with the next question adapting to probe the weakest point. Also shows a live
// (debounced, no-LLM-call) linguistic read-out while typing.
